    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Karachi: The Aga Khan University has established a Malaria Elimination Consortium (MEC) as part of its efforts to strengthen the National Malaria Elimination Programme in Pakistan. The first hybrid meeting of the AKU-Malaria Elimination Consortium (MEC), organized by the Department of Pathology and Laboratory Medicine at AKU, shared the activities and objectives of the MEC, which aims to eliminate malaria across the country by 2035.",
